================================================================================
MODUL 1: AUTENTIKASI PENGGUNA
================================================================================
No | Fungsi           | Skenario                      | Hasil Diharapkan              | Hasil | Ket
---|------------------|-------------------------------|-------------------------------|-------|-----
1  | Halaman Login    | Mengakses halaman login       | Form login ditampilkan        | [ ]   |
2  | Login Berhasil   | Input email & password valid  | Masuk ke dashboard            | [ ]   |
3  | Login Gagal      | Input email/password salah    | Pesan error muncul            | [ ]   |
4  | Validasi Login   | Submit form kosong            | Pesan validasi muncul         | [ ]   |
5  | Halaman Register | Akses halaman registrasi      | Form register ditampilkan     | [ ]   |
6  | Register Berhasil| Isi form dengan data valid    | Akun dibuat & login otomatis  | [ ]   |
7  | Logout           | Tekan tombol logout           | Keluar & ke halaman login     | [ ]   |

================================================================================
MODUL 2: DASHBOARD
================================================================================
No | Fungsi              | Skenario                    | Hasil Diharapkan              | Hasil | Ket
---|---------------------|-----------------------------|------------------------------ |-------|-----
1  | Akses Dashboard     | Buka dashboard setelah login| Statistik lengkap tampil      | [ ]   |
2  | Total Jenis Obat    | Lihat statistik jenis obat  | Jumlah jenis obat tampil      | [ ]   |
3  | Total Stok          | Lihat statistik total stok  | Jumlah unit stok tampil       | [ ]   |
4  | Peringatan Stok     | Lihat obat stok rendah      | Obat stok < 50 tampil         | [ ]   |
5  | Obat Terbaru        | Lihat obat baru ditambahkan | 5 obat terbaru tampil         | [ ]   |

================================================================================
MODUL 3: MANAJEMEN DATA OBAT
================================================================================
No | Fungsi              | Skenario                    | Hasil Diharapkan              | Hasil | Ket
---|---------------------|-----------------------------|------------------------------ |-------|-----
1  | Daftar Obat         | Akses halaman daftar obat   | Tabel obat ditampilkan        | [ ]   |
2  | Tambah Obat         | Tambah data obat valid      | Data tersimpan di daftar      | [ ]   |
3  | Validasi Tambah     | Tambah obat field kosong    | Pesan validasi muncul         | [ ]   |
4  | Edit Obat           | Ubah data obat              | Data berhasil diperbarui      | [ ]   |
5  | Modal Edit          | Buka modal edit             | Data obat tampil di modal     | [ ]   |
6  | Hapus Obat          | Hapus data obat             | Data terhapus dari sistem     | [ ]   |
7  | Konfirmasi Hapus    | Batalkan hapus              | Data tidak terhapus           | [ ]   |
8  | Status Stok Aman    | Tambah obat stok > 100      | Label "Stok Aman" (hijau)     | [ ]   |
9  | Status Stok Sedang  | Tambah obat stok 50-100     | Label "Stok Sedang" (kuning)  | [ ]   |
10 | Status Stok Rendah  | Tambah obat stok < 50       | Label "Stok Rendah" (merah)   | [ ]   |

